SDE-FLTK changes (DebION Dev-Team)

1.3.11-sde1  2026-10-20
  - Imported FLTK 1.3.11 into the SDE repository as SDE-FLTK.
  - Removed test/example programs, IDE files, documentation sources and the
    bundled zlib/libjpeg/libpng (system libraries are used).
  - FL/sde_fltk.h: SDE_FLTK_VERSION for SDE programs ("About" pages).
